  "query": "-- The document row an explicit document delete locks.\n--\n-- The group is part of the lock, so a delete never touches a document of\n-- another group.\nSELECT id, group_id, source_key, external_id\nFROM context69.documents\nWHERE id = $1\n  AND group_id = $2\nFOR UPDATE\n",
